Language acceptor
Here is a Python class for a machine that “accepts” the language that is any prefix of the infinite sequence [’a’, ’b’, ’c’, ’a’, ’b’, ’c’, ....].
class ABC(SM): startState = 0 def getNextValues(self, state, inp): if state == 0 and inp == ’a’: return (1, True) elif state == 1 and inp == ’b’: return (2, True) elif state == 2 and inp == ’c’: return (0, True) else: return (3, False)
